{"id":"5031","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5031_main_stratus-sea-fog-and-cumulus_clouds-hydrometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>低 <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">层云</span>，可能是海面上的海雾，位于英国苏格兰西部奥本附近的利斯莫尔岛西岸。在北面的苏格兰大陆山脉上空较远的地方还能看着正在发展的 <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">中积云</span>。天空中还有一点 <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">卷云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Ian Simpson","location":"大不列颠及北爱尔兰联合王国苏格兰奥本","latitude":"纬度: 56° 28' 60'' N","longitude":"经度: 5° 33' 0'' W","date":"03 August 2011 1000 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东北","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.8.0","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.8.0"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5031_syn_stratus-sea-fog-and-cumulus_clouds-hydrometeors.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>这里看到的是一个复杂的天气情况，0000 UTC时，大部分不列颠群岛上空都覆盖着一个低压区，而英国苏格兰北部则是锋面波低气压区（1014 hPa）并向北移动。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇冠版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5031_upper_stratus-sea-fog-and-cumulus_clouds-hydrometeors.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>0000 UTC时，北爱尔兰附近的探测显示，随着白天对陆地的加热，低层大气有利于积云的形成，顶部受到840 hPa逆温的限制。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5875_main_stratus-nebulosus-opacus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>层云通常是灰色云层，云底相当均匀，它可带来毛毛雨、雪或米雪。当透过层云可看到太阳（或月亮）时，其轮廓清晰可辨。在本图中，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云是均匀的灰色，没有可辨的形状</span>，因而可将其确定为薄幕云种。它还十分浓密且蔽光，无法看到太阳，可确定为蔽光云类。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Michael Bruhn","location":"奥地利，维也纳，内城","latitude":"纬度: 48° 12' 23'' N","longitude":"经度: 16° 21' 50'' E","date":"13 October 2014 1227 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 6, CM= /, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.8.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.8.3"},{"src":"/images/compressed/4993_main_cumulus-mediocris_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>图为中积云，这是一系列清晰轮廓的独立云；云底相对<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">较暗，几乎是水平的</span>，而顶部是被阳光照射的，显示为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">明亮的白色</span>。云层表现出适度的垂直发展，顶部有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">小突起和云芽</span>，是典型的中云云种。没有降水。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Stefan Kämpfe","location":"德国爱尔福特","latitude":"纬度: 51° 0' 0'' N","longitude":"经度: 11° 0' 0'' E","date":"28 September 2015 1145 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东北","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: P.9.2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.9.2"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5126_main_sea-fog-advection-fog_hydrometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>在这张图片中，海雾正在平流输送至海岸上。在海面上形成浓雾（温度为8°C），并遮住了塔后面岬角。略微温暖的陆地温度（约10°C）产生了轻微的沿海微风，将雾平流到内陆，在摄影师正前面正在变薄。岬角可以估计雾的深度约为50米（150英尺），这与代表性的探测结果一致，显示出非常明显和浅的逆温。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Frank Le Blancq","location":"泽西岛圣布雷拉德Portelet湾","latitude":"纬度: 49° 10' 17'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 10' 27'' W","date":"01 March 2012 1010 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西西南","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: P.11.1.1.4.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.11.1.1.4.1"}]}]}